aches and says cannot be wrong.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Claims The Qur'an Contradicts Science?! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7tq4SvKcBbs", ((649, "10:49–11:51"), (713, "11:53–12:48"),), id: 5039)
