#passage(("Shallow knowledge of science can lead you to rejecting the creator. This modern scientific method is being used today; it's developed by a Muslim, by the way, in Spain. You're studying the physical world through experimentation, repeatability and falsification. This method has been developed by Muslims. Unlike the age of Christian, for example, where they were like: science equals witchcraft, so we're going to burn the witches; there was this conflict between God and science, we didn't have that in Islam.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Non-Muslim Students Get Introduced To The Miracles Of The Quran! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8oViMenjCIY", ((148, "2:28–3:02"),), id: 5040)
