#passage(("Me personally, I completely reject the idea of Evolution. I've seen the amount of frauds that they play and the games that they play. They try to justify the theory of evolution scientifically. In their own magazines, they will claim lies that the same magazine would refute. This is my personal perspective when it comes to the theory of evolution. I wholesale reject it, based on my research, based on looking at certain people who made different series explaining the evidences.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Atheist Challenges Muslim On Evolution! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hBuaweGxlDg", ((10, "0:10–1:12"),), id: 5044)
