tor, they wouldn't exist. They're only allowed to exist because the creator allows them to exist, and they are deficient.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Claims That Pantheism Is More Rational Than Monotheism! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C3BXt0zJr3o", ((1782, "29:42–31:10"), (1870, "31:10–31:34"), (1894, "31:34–32:28"),), id: 5092)
