#passage(("Some people are saying, what's an omnist? When you make an omelette, you can add different ingredients. You can add salt, you can add pepper, you can add cheese, you can add meat, you can add whatever you want. So Omnist is similar in that sense, if I could give an analogy: you can pick truth from each religion, from whatever you like. So an Omnist is someone who finds truth in each religion. That doesn't mean he believes in all religions, but you find certain elements that you determine to be true in these different religions after your research. That's the definition of what an Omnist is.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Omnist Left Speechless After Hearing This Muslim's Answer! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yVHQD2W5S0c", ((102, "1:42–4:03"),), id: 5100)
