#passage(("The reason is because she thought I might have been influenced by my upbringing. I think you are influenced by your upbringing. Do you know what your upbringing taught you? It taught you liberalism. Liberalism says you accept everyone: it's OK, you can be whatever you want to be; this is liberalism. Question is: I do not need to accept liberalism. Why? Because there is something in life called Truth. If there is Truth and Falsehood, then some things have to be true and some things have to be false. Islam is not Blind Faith. You've got evidences to show that this is actually from the Creator.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Atheists Challenge Muslim On The Existence of God! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FZsW9t6W52Q", ((1524, "25:24–26:35"),), id: 5105)
