every single woman, where are you going to find these women that you're talking about? That's why they are struggling in the US. Because this is the case, people are having intercourse with an unlimited amount of women. And they lie and they claim it does not influence you as a man. It does influence you as a man, because we are very visual as human beings, and when we're used to have intercourse with multiple different people, then you desire that more. Someone who's not had a past of doing that same thing, they're a lot more likely to remain in monogamous relationship with their partner, because they've not had that history.", "Another contradiction, and I'm going to end with that, because I think it's a full of contradictions ideology: the funny thing is they will try to use women's opinion when [it] suits them. So they will ask women questions, and when they give answers they like, they will go, \"Oh! That's good!\" And when they give answers they don't like: \"You can't trust women, women always lie.\" So they pick and choose. If you think these women are less than you, and you think these women are not intelligent, then you asking them questions and then following their answers when they say them is contradicting what you just were telling us 5 minutes ago.", "So that ideology is crumbling from all of these aspects. It has a lot of problems, but of course it talks about good things. For example, it tells you to be a strong masculine individual. You have to be a strong man, you have to provide, take care of your family. It teaches you that you have to be aware of certain behaviors of certain women; it teaches you about their mentality as well, a bit about their psychology. And that's the point I'm making. Give me something that is not already there. I'm going to say, \"OK, I like your ideology, where is the Truth that is there, that is not in Islam?\" Islam has already told me anything you can, or you would tell me! And that is not the case with any other religion. You're not going to find these things in Christianity. You're not going to find them in other religions, and you'll only find them in Islam.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “The Muslim Lantern Gets Sneak∅ To Rethink His Views! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ocg_ABofNVU", ((2451, "40:51–41:25"), (2552, "42:32–43:20"), (2608, "43:28–45:12"), (2717, "45:17–46:01"), (2766, "46:06–46:46"), (2812, "46:52–47:28"), (2853, "47:33–48:11"),), id: 5129)

