#passage(("First, the Shubuhat of doubts, one of these things that are most prominent today Muslims are facing, not only in the West by the way. The reality is: what happens in the West is by extension influencing everyone else in the world, because of social media, because of what people watch, etc.", "One of these doubts that they put forward is the idea of Liberalism. They say to you, \"You are Free!\" \"OK, I'm free, yes.\" \"You're free to do whatever you want.\" \"OK, is there any exception?\" \"Yes, you can not harm another person.\" \"That's it!? So, I can do whatever I want?\" \"Yes, do whatever you want, you are free. You're your own person, you can do whatever you like as long as you don't harm anyone else.\" Now this is the idea of Liberalism that unfortunately Muslims have adopted. We're not talking about the beliefs of the West; we're talking about the beliefs of Muslims. Today Muslims come to the Da'wa table, you speak with a Muslim, and ask him, \"How do we know right from wrong?\" He says: \"As long as you don't harm anyone else,\" \"do to others as you like done to yourself.\" These statements and saying are all saying the same thing. And where did they get this from? University, School, Colleagues, non-Muslim \"Friends\"! And they end up coming to you with this Ideology now.", "And that is why you see them more lenient with certain things: they're more lenient with rainbow flags, and people of rainbow flags. Why are they lenient? Because they've adopted the Ideology: \"There's no problem. We can say to them happy Christmas, happy holidays, it's OK! Do to others as you like done to you, no one is hurting anyone.\" This guy becomes an Atheist: \"Why Islam have a punishment for the guy who leaves Islam? Do to others what you like done to you, he's not harming anyone!\" At all! He's just spreading doubts in the hearts of Muslims, nothing else.", "So, Muslims have adopted this Ideology, even though we ourselves know that in reality, even they themselves don't follow this rule, because there are many things which are harmful, which they don't forbid in their countries. Do they forbid Alcohol? Don't they agree that Alcohol is one of the main causes of cancer? Gives you cancerous cells, and kidney failure. They will tell you: \"Yeah, of course!\" Isn't dealing with Gambling a big problem in the Society, that causes people to become homeless, murderers, rapists, and thieves? \"Yes!\" \"Do you forbid it?\" \"No, we don't forbid it, because we mean harm as an individual, we don't mean harm as a society!\" So this idea of Liberalism is a Selfish idea; it is the idea of \"ME\", me before everyone else. Is it harming me? No, then it's OK. But it's harming everyone else in the community. \"Yeah, that's a different story; as long as it's not harming ME it's OK.\"", "And you find certain things that are not harming anyone. A common example of that: You'll ask one of them, OK, two people, brother and sister, and they want to have intercourse, or brother and brother, they want to have intercourse with each other. Why is that wrong? They say it's disgusting. OK, but disgusting, is it against the law? Why is it wrong? It's your rule; you just said to us do to others like done to yourself, and as long as you don't harm anyone else you're fine, and they're doing it to themselves, right? \"Why is it wrong?\" \"No, it's just.. This is too far!\" So they have red lines, but those red lines that they use are not even in accordance to their rule. So the rule is depending on what they think, what they like: \"OK, this is OK,\" \"this is tomorrow might be OK.\" And you have in certain parts in America they try to legalise incest today, they're trying to legalise it, because they have their argument: \"Love is love, and we're not harming anyone else\"! Same arguments that the other people are using. They go to the court and they say, \"Love is Love, I'm not harming anyone else, it's just my brother! And he's my brother, look, we're not going to have any children, so don't say to me deformed children\" (even though you can use contraception; you don't need to have children with a woman, you can avoid it). But we are saying brother and brother! So they don't play this game, and they say: \"Gay rights!\" And \"love is love\" and \"I'm not harming anyone else\", and they have a very strong case, isn't it? According to your liberal values, they have actually the strongest case. You have no actual reason, which is reasonable, you can use to say that this is not OK, based on your rule. But we have Muslims today adopting this idea, even though you see how problematic the idea is, and you see how this idea is not even being implemented by those own people who adopt it. But you have Naive Muslims who left the teachings of their own religion, and adopted this idea of Liberalism.", "Another idea is what? Is Feminism. What is Feminism? We're equal, we're independent. \"If you don't shake my hand, then you don't see me as an equal. If I'm not your equal, then you are Misogynistic. You're a woman hating \"Bigot\", that's what you are, because you don't want to shake my hand, the Majestic hand!\" So, they have this idea of Feminism, which effectively says that men and women are equal, and they should be treated the same way. There shouldn't be any difference. But don't you agree with me that men and women are Physiologically different? Yes, they're different, they're not the same. A woman becomes pregnant -according to us at least, because some of them believe men become pregnant! That's a different story- but, in common sense, women become pregnant and men don't become pregnant. They have maternity leave, they have a menstrual cycle, that menstrual cycle takes a specific period of time. Men do not have a menstrual cycle. Their Psychology works differently, and those are all established Scientifically. And they themselves, through own published Works, they will say to you, \"Yes, of course, we are Psychologically different.\" Even the founders of Feminism, Simone de Beauvoir, and all of those people who are the founders of the first movements of Feminism, they would say the same thing. They would say: We admit that men and women are different, Biologically and Psychologically. But they should be treated the same!", "OK, so how would you treat two different things the same way? How is that Just? If he has four children and you have two, and I give both of you 200£, it's equality. But because you're different, your situation is different, it's NOT JUST. Teaching a person who's 50 years old Quantum Mechanics, and teaching a 10 years old Quantum Mechanics is equal, but it's stupid! Because one understands what you say, and the other doesn't understand. They're different; they have a different capacity of intellect and understanding. Because they're different, giving them the same treatment is just Ignorant.", "What is the reason they brought Feminism to begin with? It is because they wanted women to go into the workforce. Because when you have men and women going into the workforce, you have double the money coming, instead of just one income coming. And it's because women are the majority of consumers; they buy things more than men buy things, they're more interested in this, in buying outfits, buying clothes, buying decorations, and all of these things. The more money they have, the more they're going to spend. \"Why do you only have one household, where the man is the provider and the woman is home raising the Next Generation? No no! We want both the men and women to work, and then we'll tell them that you're both equal, and you're just a prisoner at home!\" \"Because you're a prisoner at home we're going to free you.\" \"How are you going to free me?\" \"Take your clothes off! You take your clothes off, you become free! So take your clothes off and then go to work, then say to the man: don't you dare to speak to me.\" Every man? No, your boss, you have to listen to what he says. But your husband, you say to him: \"Look, we're equal!\" But the boss: \"Yes sir! One cup of coffee. There you go!\" So you listen to your boss, but you don't listen to your husband, and you become equal! Because your boss is important, he's the one who's going to give us the money. We want you in the workforce; you got to listen to your boss and do as your boss says, but your husband there, he's just controlling you, keeping you a prisoner. Don't listen to him, take your clothes off, and go to work!", "And then, this stupid ideology is the ideology that Muslim women have adopted -not all Muslim women, of course not all- but many Muslim women, they've adopted this stupid ideology, which now they tell you: \"I don't want to get married.\" Because in Islam, we are not going to commit Zina. So you should get married. \"I don't want to get married.\" \"Why don't you want to get married?\" \"I need to work on myself, find myself.\" \"What do you mean by find yourself? Did you get lost or something?\" \"No, I'm going to find myself!\" \"How are you going to find yourself? You're in front of me here!\" \"No, I need to find myself first, become educated and experience life, and then have my degree.\" \"Why do you want to have your degree?\" \"I want to have my degree, because maybe one day divorce will happen. And what am I going to do when I get divorced?\" \"So you're getting married with the intention of divorce?\" \"Kind of, yeah!\" Why do you get married to begin with then? If you're getting married with the intention of divorce, what's the point? They come up with this idea, they say to you: \"You know what, we're equal, I'm going to be educated and smart, and find myself, and spend years in University, and this is \"True Freedom\" as a woman.\" And then become miserable later on, when no one wants to marry you! But they don't mention that part; that part is not important for Feminism.", "This is a stupid Ideology, as we can see. If you don't believe me about this stupid Ideology, look at the West: Highest rates of divorce, highest rates of depression for women, people are barely getting married anymore. I don't need to prove this. This is a fact! Just look at the stats in any country; the government stats itself will tell you: Divorces are happening and increasing, women are more depressed than ever. And I mentioned studies before, multiple times, like \"Blanchflower and Oswald\", which is a study done from 1970 or 1960 to 2000s, since the start of the movement of Feminism, and they say women are depressed, less well-being than ever, they're not happy about their lives, taking antidepressants, committing self-deletion and all of these things. So they're not happy, but Muslim women are adopting this Ideology!",), "The Muslim Lantern, “The Situation Of The Ummah, The Disease & The Cure | Al Muwahiddeen Mosque - The Netherlands |”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ycNKKOx2jg", ((550, "9:10–9:29"), (573, "9:33–10:33"), (644, "10:44–11:17"), (683, "11:23–12:18"), (744, "12:24–14:14"), (860, "14:20–15:47"), (949, "15:49–16:21"), (987, "16:27–17:47"), (1072, "17:52–19:00"), (1145, "19:05–19:51"),), id: 5131)
