es that have been put on you from social media, because they put obedience like some crazy thing. However, this obedience is in that which is good, and that is the thing that is going to give harmony in the family and is going to allow it to function the right way.", "Sisters wouldn't have problems with obedience if it's in work: you would obey your boss. If your boss says do this or don't do that, you'll have to do it because he's your boss, and all he's doing is he's paying you some money. That's it. So your husband, he's also taking care of you financially. Why is it different?",), "The Muslim Lantern, “The Muslim Marriage Crisis: Causes, Effects & Solutions | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=03ZEqe5zZFo", ((1425, "23:45–24:30"), (1470, "24:30–25:43"), (1544, "25:44–25:57"),), id: 5135)

