#passage(("We're coming again to the same idea of being brainwashed: brushing off the western lands and saying that: \"They have some mistakes, but look at the Muslim world! They're doing this...\" It shows the level of brainwashing that a person has. If you agreed that there are problems here and there, then you wouldn't highlight the Muslim lands to begin with, as if they're an exception to the rule. So now what you're doing is, you took your first stance: \"Look, the non-Muslim world is advanced and the Muslim world is not!\" Now it became: \"Oh, everyone has mistakes!\" So why did you come in the beginning then and make the claim that: \"Look, the western lands are advanced\"? No! They're not advanced. This is the reality when you look at their behaviour and you look at their lives. And to claim that the Muslim lands have the same thing is completely false.", "Most of these Muslim countries that you refer to, even though right now they start having some problems here and there because they've been influenced by the West, for example the people influenced by Feminism, you see the divorce rates are increasing in some of these lands, but they're still lower, much lower than the West. You don't see kids chopping off their genitals in Muslim lands; you don't see this being preached in schools. You don't see everywhere people walking naked in Pride parades. So you can pretend that this is the same case in Muslim lands, but it is not. It is nowhere near. The importance of family, the importance of obeying God, the fear of stealing: in Qatar today, if you go to Qatar, you can leave your car open in the middle of the road and no one will touch it. People leave their laptop, they come three days later in the restaurant and they take it. Now you show me in which western country you can do this today. Don't try to compare and pretend, as I said in the beginning, as if \"everyone has bad things\". No, if you look at the moral ideas I'm telling you about, the Muslim land is far superior from everything I referred to: the idea of feminism, LGBT, safety, all of these things. The lands that actually implement some of Islam, not even all of Islam. Does that mean that these countries are perfect? Of course not. They're not perfect in the parts in which they're not applying Islam, and the problem is that they're having problems that they're starting to move away from Islam.", "So when you say, \"If this was not the case, my family wouldn't be here\": if you look at what happened to Afghanistan. You call yourself Afghan, but you've not seen what the US did to your country? You've not seen why those people went to your country to begin with? Because of the resources that they have. They went to that country, they tried to force their own things on your country, and they're still being kicked out by the (Afghans). Those \"so advanced\" people that have the biggest weapons, and they've been kicked out like losers by a bunch of people who live in the mountains, may Allahﷻ preserve them, because they have the religion, they have their faith in the Creator, they know this is The Truth. They know that those people might have some advanced material from worldly weapons, but when it comes to the Akhira (Hereafter), they have nothing; they fear death, while we know what is to come after we die. That's the difference between us and them.", "So your parents might have travelled and come there; it is because of economic needs, it has nothing to do with this land being not good from a moral aspect. Now why did they have economic problems? It is because of the same countries that they travelled to. They travelled to the US or whatever it is. It is because the US went to their country and destroyed it. It's the only reason they have a bad economy, that they had to travel in the first place! You are leaving the reason why your country has a bad economy, which is the West, and then saying: \"Oh, that's why they went to the West!\" No, they went to the West because they had to go; they had no other options, because their countries were being attacked day and night. So clearly you see the brainwashing now: when I tell you the history and what actually happens in history, you start to realise how brainwashed you are by what these people are telling you, leaving out all of the facts that I'm telling you.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Afghan Girl Claims That Muslims Are Blind Followers?! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7HhWSHopwFc", ((1063, "17:43–18:17"), (1100, "18:20–19:34"), (1182, "19:42–20:20"), (1225, "20:25–21:06"),), id: 5142)
