#passage(("He says we have an inferior culture, and he says that we unalive people and all of that, looking at recent history, and then he talks about the Western culture being a superior culture. But we know that the First and Second World War were not Muslim wars. The biggest killing in human history was not done by Muslims. And Naveed Sheikh has a study in National University where he highlights human death toll: you have number one is atheism, number two is Christianity. These are the Western nations. The bombing of Hiroshima and Nagasaki in Japan wasn't by Muslims. The Crusades were not Muslims. Hitler, Stalin, and the list goes on, Mao in China: all of these people were not Muslims. We look at the biggest killings in human history: they were conducted by that Western civilisation that you're telling us is better. And like I said, you're saying that we have an inferior culture, and the Western culture is better, but you're saying we're going to do the same thing we're doing. So how is it a better culture, and you're going to do the same thing that you're accusing the Muslims of doing, essentially?", "He says \"we're not their allies\". We have commonalities between Muslims and Christians, for instance. We have commonalities with people, but we can live in harmony in our society. Muslims lived in harmony with non-Muslims. At the time of the Prophet, there were Jews and Christians in Medina and the Prophet lived with them. We lived in societies with non-Muslims; we did in the Ottoman Empire for hundreds of years, and people were allowed to practise their religion in their own courts.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Asmongold Wants To Read The Quran?! Chunkz Will Disown His Kids If They Leave Islam?!”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y2zJLeRXXXk", ((372, "6:12–7:06"), (431, "7:11–7:28"),), id: 5143)
