#passage(("Do you know who forces their ideologies on people? It's the West! Who went to Afghanistan and said, we want to liberalize the Afghani people? Who went to Iraq claiming there's WMDs in there, so they can destroy the country and take its resources? What is today Israel doing to the Palestinian people, and saying: \"Oh, they don't have this and that. We are better, so we are going to do all of that. We are going to liberalize these people and bring them into the democratic beliefs and whatever.\"", "The US putting sanctions on Brunei! Now Brunei said: \"We are going to apply God's law 100%.\" So the US started putting sanctions on them, and other countries in the West! What Brunei wanted to do is to 100% apply Islamic law. That's it! It's a Muslim country. It's a small place, it's a small island. They wanted to apply God's laws. Now, the West is like: \"Wait! Did we give you permission to do that? You're not going to be doing that unless we give you permission.\" Look at Trump and his allies who talk about Somalia, going attacking it every day. What do you want with Somalia? Leave the people, the Muslim people alone! But day and night, Western nations are bombing, attacking, invading our countries.", "Look at what the French did when they went to Algeria. Over 100 years there. They have museums in France where they show skulls of people. Today, we can look at, in France, the machines they were using. They were torturing our people. They prevented the Algerian people from teaching or learning the Arabic language! They told them you have to speak in French. That's why they speak French. \"You have to become like us. You have to be \"liberalized\". We're coming here to \"enlighten\" you.\" Who does that? It's the West. The West is the one that enforces sanctions, that has whatever called \"international law\", which they made, the West. They didn't come to me and ask my nation and Muslims, do you agree with this international law?! No! Human rights, what THEY call \"human rights\" (not that we necessarily agree with their definition of human rights). Day and night, talking about Afghanistan and Iran: \"Look what they're doing to women\", etc. Day and night: \"Oh, they're not liberal like us.\"", "The people who have an issue and want to change an ideology of others is the West. It's not Muslims! Muslims have been living in non-Muslim countries for years. None of them have went and then started applying their law. It didn't happen. Show me an example of this happening. But I show you a hundred examples now of the opposite happening, even today. The Syrian president, who just recently became president: I think they just had him on the [terrorist] list or whatever, and they started sending him people saying, \"Oh, you have to do this and this and that,\" or \"If you don't do this and that, we're going to do this to you\"! What do you got to do with our nations? Leave us alone! The Syrian people had enough massacres in their life from Bashar. Why don't you leave our countries alone?", "Do you know who has bases in every Muslim country in the Middle East? The liberal USA, American USA, Christian, whatever term you want to use for it. Not a single Muslim country in the world has bases in the West. We don't do that! This is done to us. And this is a threat. Whenever the US wants to do something, it has a base here: \"We're going to do this to you.\" Like we see what's happening with Iran and IsraHell. They have bases close. And they keep making these threats: \"Oh, we have our soldiers\", \"We have our planes\". Day and night! Trump is like: \"Oh, surrender!\" He thinks he's the main character or something. These guys bombed Iran first, and then Iran sent them missiles back. Why are you complaining about \"you're attacking me first\"? You've been slaughtering Palestinians for years and years and years, and when you're attacked back, now you're crying. And then you get Trump, the \"sugar daddy of IsraHell\", making all of these empty threats. The only one who really wants to enforce and persecute and push their methodologies is not the Muslim people.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Tran$gender Challenges Muslim On His Comments About LGTBQ Community! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XPGGQKYFYqo", ((957, "15:57–16:19"), (985, "16:25–17:15"), (1039, "17:19–18:06"), (1093, "18:13–18:51"), (1138, "18:58–20:08"),), id: 5146)
