#passage(("My advice to someone who wants to create a YouTube channel is: do something better, probably. I don't really see much of a benefit there. If you're not doing it for financial gains, then I would advise doing something else. If you're doing it for financial gains, YouTube ads are anyways very problematic. It's not permissible for you to completely earn from them money, and then you have other issues. So why not think about something: as a person who is qualified in tech, making something or helping develop things that are helping Muslims? Why not do that? Why not, for example, develop an app or do something like that, that helps Muslims? There are so many things that are missing. I would redirect your energy there. I'm not saying, of course, it's haram or anything like that. You can do what you want to do. It's up to you. If you're asking my personal advice on this issue, I'll tell you that I would look for something more beneficial.", "[The Prophet] said: if the son of Adam dies, stop, except for three things. What are the three things? Beneficial knowledge that you leave behind. If I leave beneficial knowledge behind me after I die, this is going to give me reward in the grave. My deeds will not stop. My knowledge I left behind will bring me good deeds. I'm in the grave, but they're bringing me good deeds. And a righteous son that makes dua for you. And, let's say for example, you buy a [mushaf], if you put it in the mosque, you build a mosque, or you help dawa in a way where someone becomes a Muslim: their families in the future, they will also be Muslim, practicing Islam. All of it is your deeds. Every Muslim now is in the scale of the prophet, because he's the one who invited everybody to Islam. So I would recommend doing that over just something that is worldly. So, you have an expertise on something; use it in benefiting the [ummah] as a whole, cuz we do need that, especially in this day and age where all of these issues are happening with AI.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “How Do You Know Which Religion Is From God? A Detailed Comprehensive Analysis | The Muslim Lantern”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9F5gS1yWIRI", ((5042, "1:24:02–1:25:15"), (5119, "1:25:19–1:26:22"),), id: 5180)

